## 2. Verspektive Studios (Physical Space & Rentals)
This sub-pillar represents the physical space where the podcasts are shot. It is positioned as the 1st premium podcast studio in Tulunad.

### Team Management
- **Studios Team Showcase**: The "Team section is needed in this" requirement means we need to ensure the existing Coverflow Carousel is specifically populated with the team members responsible for operating the studio (e.g., sound engineers, camera operators, producers). This requires managing the `teams` JSON data in the database.

### Studio Rentals System (Future Phase)
To support the "Rentals in future" requirement, we will need to build a robust booking engine:
- **Interactive Booking Calendar**: A UI for users to view available time slots for the studio and select a date/time to rent it.
- **Booking Flow & Forms**: A form for users to specify their equipment needs, rental duration, and contact details.
- **Payment Gateway Integration**: Integration with Stripe or Razorpay to process upfront booking deposits or full rental payments securely.
- **Admin Rental Dashboard**: A backend interface for you to manage bookings, block out dates (when you are shooting your own TIO Originals), and manage rental invoices.
